{"meta":{"stage":"06-mirror-prs","source_org":"cyberfabric","target_org":null,"first_run_at":"2026-06-01T10:25:05Z","last_run_at":"2026-06-01T10:25:05Z"},"stats":{"total":291,"synced":0,"pending":0,"failed":0},"items":[{"source_pr_number":5,"source_url":"https://github.com/cyberfabric/cyber-insight/pull/5","source_state":"closed","source_author":"dzarlax","target_issue_number":null,"title":"[PR #5] docs: add Connectors Reference v2.13 — synced with upstream PRs","status":"exported","mirrored_at":null,"comments_status":"none","comments_mirrored":0,"pr_head_ref":"feat/connectors-reference-sync","pr_head_sha":"bcf3409acfe00fdacb837fe2669cd1ff743698f2","pr_base_ref":"main","pr_head_owner":"dzarlax","pr_from_fork":1,"source_data":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyber-insight/pulls/5","id":3354052923,"node_id":"PR_kwDORRWv8s7H6sk7","html_url":"https://github.com/cyberfabric/cyber-insight/pull/5","diff_url":"https://github.com/cyberfabric/cyber-insight/pull/5.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/cyberfabric/cyber-insight/pull/5.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyber-insight/issues/5","number":5,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"docs: add Connectors Reference v2.13 — synced with upstream PRs","user":{"login":"dzarlax","id":1673513,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2NzM1MTM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1673513?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dzarlax","html_url":"https://github.com/dzarlax","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dzarlax/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dzarlax/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dzarlax/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dzarlax/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dzarlax/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dzarlax/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dzarlax/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dzarlax/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dzarlax/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## Summary\n\n- Adds `docs/CONNECTORS_REFERENCE.md` — the canonical reference for all 20 data source connectors in Constructor Insight (Version Control, Task Tracking, Communication, HR, Directory, AI Tools, CRM, Quality)\n- Synced against upstream PRs #1 (Git ETL design), #2 (Identity/Architecture), #3 (Streams proposal) — schema conflicts resolved or documented as open questions\n\n## Key changes vs v2.12\n\n- **M365**: replaced single wide `m365_raw` table with 4 separate Bronze tables (`ms365_email_activity`, `ms365_teams_activity`, `ms365_onedrive_activity`, `ms365_sharepoint_activity`); camelCase field names matching Graph API\n- **Cursor**: camelCase field names across all 3 tables (`cursor_daily_usage`, `cursor_events`, `cursor_events_token_usage`); added `unique` and `day` fields\n- **`class_communication_events`**: updated source table references and channel mapping table\n- **`direction` field**: documented `NULL` as valid value\n- **`source_id`**: clarified Zulip uses `{source}:{id}` format (no `:{channel}` part)\n\n## Open Questions added (OQ-4 through OQ-11)\n\nUnresolved architectural decisions found by cross-referencing upstream PRs — require team alignment:\n\n| # | Topic |\n|---|-------|\n| OQ-4 | Zulip extra fields (`recipient_id`, `uniq`) |\n| OQ-5 | YouTrack `source_instance_id` missing from stream spec |\n| OQ-6 | Task tracker author/assignee: numeric UInt64 vs text |\n| OQ-7 | Silver naming: `class_*` vs `*_enriched` |\n| OQ-8 | Git Bronze: per-source tables vs unified `git_*` + `data_source`; extra tables |\n| OQ-9 | `streams/raw_git/` PostgreSQL layer — intermediate or legacy? |\n| OQ-10 | Git field naming: `owner`/`repo_name` vs `project_key`/`repo_slug` |\n| OQ-11 | Pipeline model: Medallion (Bronze/Silver/Gold) vs dbt-Mart |\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\n<!-- This is an auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->\n## Summary by CodeRabbit\n\n* **Documentation**\n  * Added a comprehensive Connector Reference and per-source connector specifications (GitHub, Bitbucket, GitLab, YouTrack, Jira, M365, Zulip, BambooHR, Workday, LDAP/AD, OpenAI/Claude/Cursor/Windsurf/GitHub Copilot, HubSpot, Salesforce, Allure, BambooHR, etc.) with Bronze/Silver/Gold schemas, unified stream mappings, identity-resolution guidance, pipeline notes, and an Open Questions section for deduplication and attribution.\n<!-- end of auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->","created_at":"2026-03-04T15:59:16Z","updated_at":"2026-03-11T12:33:01Z","closed_at":"2026-03-05T16:06:03Z","merged_at":"2026-03-05T16:06:03Z","merge_commit_sha":"d33f45946939ff69806a46e9050ee02c5a4cf2be","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":false,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyber-insight/pulls/5/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyber-insight/pulls/5/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyber-insight/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyber-insight/issues/5/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyber-insight/statuses/bcf3409acfe00fdacb837fe2669cd1ff743698f2","head":{"label":"dzarlax:feat/connectors-reference-sync","ref":"feat/connectors-reference-sync","sha":"bcf3409acfe00fdacb837fe2669cd1ff743698f2","user":{"login":"dzarlax","id":1673513,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2NzM1MTM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1673513?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dzarlax","html_url":"https://github.com/dzarlax","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dzarlax/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dzarlax/following{/other_