","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1673513?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dzarlax","html_url":"https://github.com/dzarlax","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dzarlax/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dzarlax/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dzarlax/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dzarlax/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dzarlax/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dzarlax/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dzarlax/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dzarlax/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dzarlax/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## Summary\n\nComprehensive reference of all data sources collected by Constructor Insight, updated to v2.13.\n\n**Connectors covered (20 sources):**\n- Version Control: GitHub, Bitbucket, GitLab\n- Task Tracking: YouTrack, Jira\n- Communication: Microsoft 365 (incl. M365 Copilot), Zulip\n- AI Dev Tools: Cursor, Windsurf, Claude API, Claude Team, GitHub Copilot, OpenAI API, ChatGPT Team\n- HR / Directory: BambooHR, Workday, LDAP / Active Directory\n- CRM: HubSpot, Salesforce\n- Quality: Allure TestOps\n\n**Changes in v2.12–v2.13:**\n\n- **Full Bronze → Silver → Gold pipeline** documented for Task Tracker (YouTrack + Jira):\n  - `class_task_tracker_activities` — Silver step 1, append-only unified event stream\n  - `class_task_tracker_snapshot` — Silver step 1 (parallel), current state upsert\n  - `class_task_tracker` — Silver step 2, canonical `person_id` via Identity Manager\n  - Gold derived metrics: `status_periods`, `lifecycle_summary`, `throughput`, `wip_snapshots`\n- **`class_` naming convention** established for all Silver tables (both step 1 and step 2)\n- **`class_communication_events`** renamed from `communication_events`; added `person_id` (Silver step 2) and two-step pipeline description\n- **Updated \"How Data Flows\" diagram** — Bronze / Silver two-step / Gold with Identity Manager as parallel component\n- **`source_instance_id`** added to `youtrack_issue` and `jira_issue` Bronze tables\n- **Open Questions** section with three unresolved architectural decisions:\n  - OQ-1: Git commit deduplication across mirrored sources\n  - OQ-2: Identity re-resolution strategy when person mappings change\n  - OQ-3: AI API per-key attribution for `class_ai_api_usage`\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\n<!-- This is an auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->\n\n## Summary by CodeRabbit\n\n* **Documentation**\n  * Added a comprehensive Connectors Reference detailing 20 data sources (GitHub, Bitbucket, GitLab, YouTrack, Jira, Microsoft 365, Zulip, Cursor, Windsurf, BambooHR, Workday, LDAP/AD, Claude, Claude Team, GitHub Copilot, HubSpot, Salesforce, OpenAI API, ChatGPT Team, Allure TestOps).\n  * Describes end-to-end data flow (Bronze/Silver/Gold), unified streams, per-source raw schemas, identity resolution, channel/direction mappings, \"All Tables at a Glance\", open questions, and related references.\n\n<!-- end of auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->","created_at":"2026-02-23T11:42:25Z","updated_at":"2026-03-11T12:33:00Z","closed_at":"2026-03-03T16:13:37Z","merged_at":"2026-03-03T16:13:37Z","merge_commit_sha":"b2a69c5ff73e721cf89920c5e0f7c2c536e4ceca","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":false,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyber-insight/pulls/4/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyber-insight/pulls/4/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyber-insight/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyber-insight/issu