ernal_ticket_id, 1, POSITION('-' IN external_ticket_id) - 1) as jira_project,\n+    COUNT(DISTINCT external_ticket_id) as unique_tickets,\n     COUNT(*) as total_references\n FROM git_tickets\n WHERE data_source = 'insight_bitbucket_server'\n GROUP BY jira_project\n ORDER BY unique_tickets DESC;\n```\n</details>\n\n<!-- suggestion_start -->\n\n<details>\n<summary>📝 Committable suggestion</summary>\n\n> ‼️ **IMPORTANT**\n> Carefully review the code before committing. Ensure that it accurately replaces the highlighted code, contains no missing lines, and has no issues with indentation. Thoroughly test & benchmark the code to ensure it meets the requirements.\n\n```suggestion\n### Most referenced Jira tickets\n\n```\n\n</details>\n\n<!-- suggestion_end -->\n\n<details>\n<summary>🤖 Prompt for AI Agents</summary>\n\n```\nVerify each finding against the current code and only fix it if needed.\n\nIn `@connectors/git/tables/git_tickets.md` around lines 246 - 275, The SQL uses\nthe nonexistent column jira_ticket; update both queries to reference\nexternal_ticket_id instead (replace jira_ticket with external_ticket_id in\nSELECT, COUNT/DISTINCT expressions, and WHERE/GROUP BY usage), and in the \"Jira\ntickets by project prefix\" query use SUBSTRING/extraction on external_ticket_id\n(e.g., POSITION('-' IN external_ticket_id)) and COUNT(DISTINCT\nexternal_ticket_id) so the queries run against the correct column.\n```\n\n</details>\n\n<!-- fingerprinting:phantom:medusa:ocelot -->\n\n<!-- This is an auto-generated comment by CodeRabbit -->","created_at":"2026-02-18T19:12:04Z","updated_at":"2026-02-18T19:12:08Z","html_url":"https://github.com/cyberfabric/cyber-insight/pull/1#discussion_r2823999328","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyber-insight/pulls/1","_links":{"self":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyber-insight/pulls/comments/2823999328"},"html":{"href":"https://github.com/cyberfabric/cyber-insight/pull/1#discussion_r2823999328"},